    {
      "id": "e7",
      "name": "Table 6",
      "hidden": false,
      "parentId": null,
      "inheritedFrom": null,
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "\n\nEstablish inbound virtual channel with on-demand service and appointment booking as a viable alternative to branch walk-ins \n\n\nReduce branch sales headcount progressively, proportional to revenue contribution (i.e., FAs & SFAs reduced >20%)\n\n\nIncrease access to specialists with virtual capabilities to meet clients in preferred channel\nGrow specialist teams dedicated to complex products (e.g., ~1-2x for mortgage, investments)\n\n\nReduce assigned books from 600+ to ~100-200 to enable experienced advisors to focus on high-value relationships, and no assigned book for junior FAs\nLeverage LOE to manage leads rather than rely on advisor outreach via client assignment \n\n\nLeverage LiveBank as a proof of concept to support retail Smart Investor use case, leveraging lessons learned from Small Business",
      "placeholder": null,
      "typography": null,
      "sourcePart": "ppt/slides/slide17.xml",
      "relations": [],
